Output docs/demo/venom-demo.gif

Set Shell zsh
Set Width 1000
Set Height 620
Set FontSize 24
Set TypingSpeed 32ms
Set Framerate 30
Set CursorBlink false
Set Padding 20
Set Margin 30
Set BorderRadius 10
Set WindowBar Colorful

Require venom

Hide
Type `eval "$(venom hook zsh)"`
Enter
Type "cd ~/venom-demo && clear"
Enter
Show

Sleep 500ms

Type "cd ~/venom-demo"
Enter
Sleep 900ms

Type "venom status"
Enter
Sleep 2.5s

Type "venom detect"
Enter
Sleep 3s

Screenshot docs/demo/venom-detect.png

Type "venom doctor"
Enter
Sleep 4s
